{"title":"Logic books","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>These <b>Logic books</b> are recommended by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a> administrators and members of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php\">AoPS Community</a>.\n</p><p>Before adding any books to this page, please review the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPSWiki:Linking_books\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPSWiki:Linking books\">AoPSWiki:Linking books</a> page.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Books_by_subject\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Books by subject</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Digital_Logic\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Digital Logic</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Symbolic_Logic\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Symbolic Logic</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Logic_Word_Problems\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Logic Word Problems</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#General_Interest\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">General Interest</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Books_by_subject\">Books by subject</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logic_books&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Books by subject\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Digital_Logic\">Digital Logic</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logic_books&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Digital Logic\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0780334264/artofproblems-20\">Ones and Zeros: Understanding Boolean Algebra, Digital Circuits and the Logic of Sets</a> by John Gregg.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Symbolic_Logic\">Symbolic Logic</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logic_books&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Symbolic Logic\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0674244516/artofproblems-20\">Elementary Logic</a> by W.V. Quine.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Logic_Word_Problems\">Logic Word Problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logic_books&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Logic Word Problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/048647027X/artofproblems-20\">Lady or the Tiger? And Other Logic Puzzles Including a Mathematical Novel That Features Godel's Great Discovery</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0486481980/artofproblems-20\">What is the Name of this Book?</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"General_Interest\">General Interest</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logic_books&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: General Interest\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logic_books&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logic\" title=\"Logic\">Logic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics\" title=\"Mathematics\">Mathematics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Philosophy\" title=\"Philosophy\">Philosophy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_science\" title=\"Computer science\">Computer science</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018093614\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 20/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1480:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018093614 and revision id 282764. Rendering w